OL,3,GNEWSAScottish National Investment Bank
OL,4,Amakes net loss of #138m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish National Investment Bank
OL,7,Fhas revealed it made a net loss of
OL,8,F#138m last year.
OL,10,FThe state-owned body cited the the
OL,11,Fcollapse of three of its early
OL,12,Finvestments - including its first,
OL,13,FGlasgow-based laser company M Squared.
OL,15,FHowever, the bank also generated an
OL,16,Fincome of #32m, comfortably covering
OL,17,Fits operating costs of #20m.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
