OL,3,GNEWSAScottish National Investment Bank
OL,4,Amakes net loss of #138m
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive David Ritchie called
OL,7,Fthe losses "regrettable and
OL,8,Fdisappointing", but said he was
OL,9,Fdetermined to demonstrate that a
OL,10,F"commercially disciplined development
OL,11,Fbank can deliver for Scotland".
